;; LYCAN LIVE ADAPTATION — THREE ARMS, ONE CHOICE NODE
;;
;; The smallest possible learning capsule: a single AdaptiveChoice node
;; over three arms. The live dashboard sends decisions and delayed
;; feedback; you watch the weights converge on the best arm, then flip
;; the best arm and watch the policy re-adapt. No source change, no
;; retrain — the learned state lives in the persisted graph weights.
;;
;;   lycan compile demo_showoff_bandit.lycs
;;   syntra serve --store ... --admin-key ...
;;   POST /tenants/t/jobs/j/capsules/bandit/decide      -> picks an arm
;;   POST /tenants/t/jobs/j/capsules/bandit/feedback    -> reward 1.0/0.0
;;   GET  /tenants/t/jobs/j/capsules/bandit/report      -> live weights

($ arm (choice 0 1 2))

(!p "chosen_arm:" arm)
